[14785]="70047F5C\n1\tGather Remembrances (total: 10)\030Find the snow-man of Ered Luin\030Find the tallest cow of Buckland\030Find the sand castle of Evendim\030Find the cat house of Bree-town\030Find the turtle house of Bree-town\030Talk to an amateur ice-skater of Forochel\030Find the rabbit of Ost Dunhoth\030Find the rabbit cave of the Great River\030Find the Peculiar Home in Eastfold\030Find the squirrel village of the Eastfold\tCards hang from the Party Tree. Each card contains a scavenger hunt to complete at your own pace.\n2\tCompleted\tCompleted scavenger hunt card.\n",
[14786]="70047F61\n1\tDefeat foes in Annúminas (total: 8)\030Defeat foes in Garth Agarwen (total: 8)\030Defeat foes in Giant Halls (total: 8)\030Defeat foes in Giant Valley (total: 8)\030Defeat foes in Hîsuk (total: 8)\030Defeat foes in Limlight Gorge (total: 8)\030Defeat foes in Ost Alagos (total: 8)\030Defeat foes in Sarnúr (total: 8)\030Defeat foes in Tarlang's Crown (total: 8)\tCards hang from the Party Tree. Each card contains a scavenger hunt to complete at your own pace.\n2\tCompleted\tCompleted scavenger hunt card.\n",
[14787]="7002AC96\n1\tTalk to Virgil Greenfield\tVirgil Greenfield would like to teach you the simple pleasures of building a snowman. Speak to him for guidance.\n",
[14788]="70048C86\n1\tCollect sticky stuff (total: 30)\t\"Sticky Stuff\" is secreted by the Huorns and slugs in Agarnaith. You should collect \"sticky stuff.\"\n2\tTalk to Viznak\tViznak can be called with the goblin-caller. You should talk to Viznak.\n",
[14789]="700681C3\n1\tDiscover Baj Khatûg\tOversized crabs have taken over the beach of Baj Khatûg east of Zamarzîr.\n2\tDefeat crabs (total: 10)\tOversized crabs have taken over the beach of Baj Khatûg east of Zamarzîr. Defeat crabs.\n",
[14790]="70022D43\n1\tBring the letter to Albra Lowbanks in Bree\tAlbra Lowbanks sent you a letter requesting that you visit her in the training hall in Bree. Deliver the letter to Albra. She can be found in the training hall for burglars beneath the Mud-gate.\n",
[14791]="70022D62\n1\tBring the letter to Dalton Willow in Bree\tDalton Willow sent you a letter requesting that you visit him in Bree. Deliver the letter to Dalton Willow. He can be found in the Scholar's Stair in Bree.\n",
[14792]="70022D6A\n1\tBring the letter to Tralli in Bree\tTralli sent you a letter requesting that you visit him in Bree. Deliver the letter to Tralli. He can be found in the training area near the Bree Jail.\n",
[14793]="70022D6C\n1\tBring the letter to Flambard Took in Bree\tFlambard Took sent you a letter requesting that you visit him in Bree. Deliver the letter to Flambard Took. He can be found in Bree.\n",
[14794]="70022D71\n1\tBring the letter to Dawn Appledore in Bree\tDawn Appledore sent you a letter requesting that you visit her in the training hall in Bree. Deliver the letter to Dawn Appledore. She can be found in the training hall for captains within the Bree Jail.\n",
[14795]="70022D72\n1\tBring the letter to Oggur in Bree\tOggur sent you a letter requesting that you visit him in the training hall in Bree. Deliver the letter to Oggur. He can be found in the training area near the Bree Jail.\n",
[14796]="70022D73\n1\tBring the letter to Burt Nine-tales in Bree\tBurt Nine-tales sent you a letter requesting that you visit him in Bree. Deliver the letter to Burt Nine-tales. He can be found in the Prancing Pony within the town of Bree.\n",
[14797]="70022D75\n1\tBring the letter to Biarn in Bree\tBiarn sent you a letter requesting that you visit him in Bree. Deliver the letter to Biarn. He can be found in the Scholar's Stair in Bree.\n",
[14798]="70022D77\n1\tBring the letter to Daisy Appledore in Bree\tDaisy Appledore sent you a letter requesting that you visit her in Bree. Deliver the letter to Daisy Appledore. She can be found in the Bree Jail.\n",
[14799]="700586B5\n1\tBring the letter to Brom Hawksbeard in Bree Jail\tBrom Hawksbeard sent you a letter requesting that you visit him in the Bree Jail. Deliver the letter to Brom. He can be found in the Bree Jail.\n",
[14800]="70064227\n1\tBring the letter to Mick Maidenhair in the Dwarrow-ward, in Bree-town\tMick Maidenhair sent you a letter requesting that you visit him in the Dwarrow-ward, in Bree-town. Deliver the letter to Mick Maidenhair. He can be found in the Dwarrow-ward, in Bree-town.\n",
[14801]="7000C71D\n1\tTalk to Hal Hornblower\030Talk to Postman Grubb\030Talk to Daddy Twofoot\030Talk to Holly Hornblower\030Talk to Shirriff Robin Smallburrow\030Talk to Tavern Keep\030Talk to Opal Goodbody\030Talk to Bogo Chubb\030Talk to Gaffer Gamgee\030Talk to Ted Sandyman\tHobbiton lies far to the east of Michel Delving. Will Whitfoot has given you an official petition and has sent you to Hobbiton to find ten inhabitants to sign your petition.\n2\tTalk to Lobelia Sackville-Baggins\030Collect Official Shire Petition\tLobelia Sackville-Baggins is at Bag End on the Hill in Hobbition. Having obtained ten signatures, you should bring the signed petition to Lobelia Sackville-Baggins.\n",
[14802]="700330AB\n1\tParticipate in a Yule Festival activity in Frostbluff\tEvery day there is something to do in Frostbluff. Every day there is Yule! Come and join everyone in Frostbluff and complete a Yule Festival activity. We have a Sack of Presents waiting for you!\n2\tParticipate in a Yule Festival activity in Frostbluff\tEvery day there is something to do in Frostbluff. Every day there is Yule! Come and join everyone in Frostbluff and complete a Yule Festival activity We have a Sack of Presents waiting for you.\n3\tSpeak to Mara Sandydowns\tMara Sandydowns would like to thank you for your participation in the Yule Festival today.\n",
[14803]="70032DBA\n1\tComplete to receive a map to Winter-home!\tThe Yule Festival is a time of celebration and merriment. Come and join the festivities in Frostbluff and drink, eat, and be merry. Happy Yule!\n2\tComplete to receive a map to Winter-home in Frostbluff.\tThe Yule Festival is a time of celebration and merriment. Come and join the festivities in Frostbluff and drink, eat, and be merry. Happy Yule!\n",
[14804]="700733B5\n1\tDeliver 2500 Embers of Enchantment to Mara Sandydowns in Winter-home\030Deliver 2500 Embers of Enchantment to Calúrmin at Sul Madásh\tCelebrate Yule!\n",
[14805]="700733B2\n1\tDeliver 10 Perfect Snowballs to Mara Sandydowns in Winter-home\030Deliver 10 Mûr Ghala Sarzái to Calúrmin at Sul Madásh\tCelebrate Yule!\n",
[14806]="7000C71F\n1\tTalk to Ted Sandyman\030Talk to Holly Hornblower\030Talk to Hal Hornblower\030Talk to Postman Grubb\030Talk to Daddy Twofoot\030Talk to Shirriff Robin Smallburrow\030Talk to Tavern Keep\030Talk to Opal Goodbody\030Talk to Bogo Chubb\030Talk to Gaffer Gamgee\030Talk to Lobelia Sackville-Baggins\030Talk to Lotho Sackville-Baggins\tYou have been asked to inquire among the Hobbiton-folk for an explanation of Lobelia's post as Yule-planner.\n2\tSearch Sandyman's Mill for anything out of the ordinary\tSandyman's Mill is north of the bridge over the Water in Hobbiton. Ted Sandyman's unusual behaviour might suggest a need to search Sandyman's Mill for anything out of the ordinary.\n3\tTalk to Mayor Will Whitfoot\030Collect Invitation\tWill Whitfoot is at the Town Hole in Michel Delving, far to the west of Hobbiton. You should report your findings to Will Whitfoot, the Mayor of the Shire.\n",
[14807]="7007210E\n1\tDefeat oryx near Sâkhazai (total: 5)\tDefeat oryx near Sâkhazai for their meat. Numûru is making his famous stew, nakhód júra, and needs oryx meat for it. Sâkhazai is located north-west of Ingar-garâsh.\n2\tGather wood for a fire near Sâkhazai (total: 6)\tGather wood for a fire near Sâkhazai in Kighân. Sâkhazai is located north-west of Ingar-garâsh.\n3\tSpeak with the farmer outside of Ingar-garâsh\tSpeak with the farmer Aphadar outside of Ingar-garâsh to harvest chickpeas for the stew.\n4\tHarvest chickpeas from Aphadar's field (total: 12)\tHarvest chickpeas from Aphadar's field outside of Ingar-garâsh.\n5\tSpeak with Numûru in Ingar-garâsh\tReturn to Ingar-garâsh and tell Numûru you have collected the necessary items.\n6\tMake a camp-fire in Ingar-garâsh\tMake a camp-fire within Ingar-garâsh.\n7\tAdd a nearby cauldron to the roaring fire\tAdd a nearby cauldron to the roaring fire in Ingar-garâsh.\n8\tAdd in stew ingredients to the cauldron\tAdd in water, the stew ingredients, and Numûru's spices to the cauldron.\n9\tStir the stew in Ingar-garâsh\tStir the stew in Ingar-garâsh.\n10\tTaste the stew in Ingar-garâsh\tTaste the stew in Ingar-garâsh.\n11\tReturn to Numûru with a bowl of nakhód júra\tReturn to Numûru with a bowl of the completed nakhód júra stew in Ingar-garâsh.\n",
[14808]="70067E95\n1\tDig at the first spot\tAnyâmat would like to dredge for buried treasure on Baj Khatûg. Baj Khatûg is an island off the eastern shore of Zamarzîr.\n2\tDig at the second spot\tAnyâmat would like to dredge for buried treasure on Baj Khatûg. Baj Khatûg is an island off the eastern shore of Zamarzîr.\n3\tDig at the third spot\tAnyâmat would like to dredge for buried treasure on Baj Khatûg. Baj Khatûg is an island off the eastern shore of Zamarzîr.\n4\tDig at the fourth spot\tAnyâmat would like to dredge for buried treasure on Baj Khatûg. Baj Khatûg is an island off the eastern shore of Zamarzîr.\n5\tTalk to Anyâmat\tYou've found things that could be considered treasure. Talk to Anyâmat about what to do next. Anyâmat may be summoned by using Anyâmat's whistle from your inventory. Anyâmat may only be summoned while in and around Zamarzîr.\n",
[14809]="7005A9B9\n1\tExamine the fully restored throne\tThe Throne of Zidir-nesad can be found at the Steepset in Máttugard. You should examine the fully restored throne.\n2\tTalk to Rísti Graver\tRísti Graver can be found at the Steepset in Máttugard. You should talk to Rísti Graver.\n3\tTalk to Prince Ingór at Vérnozal\tPrince Ingór can be found at Vérnozal in Máttugard. You should talk to Prince Ingór.\n4\tReturn to the throne of Zidir-nesad\tThe Throne of Zidir-nesad can be found at the Steepset in Máttugard. You should return to the Throne of Zidir-nesad.\n5\tTalk to Prince Ingór upon the throne at Steepset\tPrince Ingór can be found at the Steepset in Máttugard. You should talk to Prince Ingór.\n6\tLook out over Máttugard at the Steepset\tThe Steepset can be found in Máttugard. You should look out over Máttugard at Steepset.\n7\tListen to the sounds of Máttugard at the Steepset\tThe Steepset can be found in Máttugard. You should listen to the sounds of Máttugard at the Steepset.\n8\tTalk to Rísti Graver\tRísti Graver can be found at the Steepset in Máttugard. You should talk to Rísti Graver.\n",
[14810]="7005A9B5\n1\tTalk to Rísti Graver\tRísti Graver can be found at the Steepset in Máttugard. You should talk to Rísti Graver.\n2\tTalk to Rísti Graver\tRísti Graver can be found at the Steepset in Máttugard. You should talk to Rísti Graver.\n3\tTalk to Mangur Bentpenny about the Jewel of Abhâr\tMangur Bentpenny can be found in the Welkin-lofts. You should talk to Mangur Bentpenny about the Jewel of Abhâr.\n4\tCollect the horn of a silver drake\tA silver drake can be found in the Welkin-lofts. You should collect the horn of a silver drake for Mangur Bentpenny.\n5\tGive the silver drake-horn to Mangur Bentpenny\tMangur Bentpenny can be found in the Welkin-lofts. You should give the silver drake-horn to Mangur Bentpenny.\n6\tTalk to Mangur Bentpenny\tMangur Bentpenny can be found in the Welkin-lofts. You should talk to Mangur Bentpenny.\n7\tCollect Iron Crown treasures (total: 8)\tIron Crown treasures can be found in the Welkin-lofts. You should collect Iron Crown treasures for Mangur Bentpenny.\n8\tGive the Iron Crown treasures to Mangur Bentpenny\tMangur Bentpenny can be found in the Welkin-lofts. You should give the Iron Crown treasures to Mangur Bentpenny.\n9\tTalk to Mangur Bentpenny\tMangur Bentpenny can be found in the Welkin-lofts. You should talk to Mangur Bentpenny.\n10\tAdd the Jewel of Abhâr to the Throne of Zidir-nesad\tThe Throne of Zidir-nesad can be found at the Steepset in Máttugard. You should add the Jewel of Abhâr to the Throne of Zidir-nesad under Rísti Graver's supervision.\n11\tTalk to Rísti Graver\tRísti Graver can be found at the Steepset in Máttugard. You should talk to Rísti Graver.\n",
[14811]="7005A9B4\n1\tTalk to Rísti Graver\tRísti Graver can be found at the Steepset in Máttugard. You should talk to Rísti Graver.\n2\tTalk to Rísti Graver\tRísti Graver can be found at the Steepset in Máttugard. You should talk to Rísti Graver.\n3\tDefeat Nakhauga\030Retrieve the Jewel of Abnâh\030Summon Nakhauga\tNakhauga can be found in Deepscrave. You should collect the Jewel of Abnâh from Nakhauga.\n4\tAdd the Jewel of Abnâh to the Throne of Zidir-nesad\tThe Throne of Zidir-nesad can be found at the Steepset in Máttugard. You should add the Jewel of Abnâh to the Throne of Zidir-nesad under Rísti Graver's supervision.\n5\tTalk to Rísti Graver\tRísti Graver can be found at Steepset in Máttugard. You should talk to Rísti Graver.\n",
[14812]="7005A9B2\n1\tTalk to Rísti Graver\tRísti Graver can be found at the Steepset in Máttugard. You should talk to Rísti Graver.\n2\tTalk to Rísti Graver\tRísti Graver can be found at the Steepset in Máttugard. You should talk to Rísti Graver.\n3\tSift through the piles of muck (total: 19)\tPiles of muck can be found in Gloomingtarn. You should sift through the muck for the Jewel of Adnâkh.\n4\tSift through one last pile of muck\tPiles of muck can be found in Gloomingtarn. You should sift through one last pile of muck for the Jewel of Adnâkh.\n5\tCollect the Jewel of Adnâkh\tThe Jewel of Adnâkh can be found in Gloomingtarn. You should collect the Jewel of Adnâkh.\n6\tAdd the Jewel of Adnâkh to the Throne of Zidir-nesad\tThe Throne of Zidir-nesad can be found at the Steepset in Máttugard. You should add the Jewel of Adnâkh to the Throne of Zidir-nesad under Rísti Graver's supervision.\n7\tTalk to Rísti Graver\tRísti Graver can be found at Steepset in Máttugard. You should talk to Rísti Graver.\n",
